# Rendered by paisans. Do not edit: `paisans apply` overwrites this file.
#
# The token is scoped to DNS edit rights on one zone. It is the price of
# DNS-01, and it is what lets a gateway hold valid certificates before any DNS
# record points at it.
#
# The narrower arrangement, if this grant is unwanted: CNAME every
# _acme-challenge record into a challenge only zone and scope the token to
# that zone, so the credential on the gateway can write challenges and nothing
# else.
ACME_DNS_TOKEN={{ .ACMEDNSToken }}
